-- ============================================================================
-- Hornady POC -- ADDITIONAL sample data (extends sample-data.sql).
--
-- Adds depth so the EJS dashboards have something interesting to scroll:
--   HREMPL     +5 employees           (8 total)
--   HDCUST     +12 customers          (20 total)
--   HDIMST     +14 SKUs               (20 total)
--   HYPSGHD    +50 shipment headers   (80 total, groups 1031-1080)
--   HYPSGCU    +50 shipment-customer  (80 total)
--   HYPSGDT    +88 detail lines       (121 total)
--   HYPSGLD    +30 lot rows           (77 total)
--   PICKBATHP  +25 pick batches       (30 total, batches 5006-5030)
--   PICKBATDP  +88 pick lines         (102 total)
--
-- Idempotent: every section starts with a matching DELETE on the new
-- ranges so reruns produce the same state and never touch the original
-- sample-data.sql seed rows.
--
-- Run via aitool sql or runsqlstm.  Targets the current build schema
-- via dftrdbcol so no library prefix is needed.
-- ============================================================================

